      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I absolutely second this!  If possible, I'd also like the ability to set specific X Y and Z coordinates and rotation angles for the stream camera in the play space so that it could be precisely aligned with a real world webcam. Something akin to the way the LIV app lets you align the cameras.  This screenshot is an example of what's currently achievable by manually lining up the cameras, but an extra bit of precision would be ideal.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
